STM32 part descriptions. Each file under python/popcorn/stm32/data is built by
popcorn's description builder from the files below, which it parses and
transforms into popcorn's part description format. Memory regions and core
counts come from popcorn's own facts files under
python/popcorn/stm32/description/rzone, written from ST's reference manual and
datasheet, not from these files.

